---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Changelog" description="Insight.info product and website updates."><PageHero eyebrow="Changelog" title="What is new in Insight.info" description="New features, improvements and fixes from the Insight.info team." /><section class="shell timeline"><article><time datetime="2026-08-20">August 20, 2026</time><div><span>Launch</span><h2>Insight.info foundation</h2><p>Introduced the Insight.info identity, single-origin website, marketing and documentation routes, public dashboard URLs, PWA assets, and compatibility configuration.</p></div></article><article><time datetime="2026-08-20">August 20, 2026</time><div><span>Routing</span><h2>Readable public dashboards</h2><p>Public projects now use <code>insight.info/example.com?t=24hrs</code>, with a query-preserving compatibility redirect from the former route.</p></div></article></section></BaseLayout>
<style>.timeline{max-width:900px;padding-bottom:120px}.timeline article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:190px 1fr;gap:42px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:42px 0}.timeline time{color:var(--muted)}.timeline span{color:var(--purple);font-weight:800;font-size:13px}.timeline h2{font-size:31px;margin:10px 0}.timeline p{color:var(--muted);font-size:17px}.timeline code{background:var(--purple-soft);padding:3px 7px;border-radius:6px}@media(max-width:650px){.timeline article{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px}}</style>
